OL,3,GNEWSACrews say field fire 'started by
OL,4,Aglass bottles'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large fire which affected a field and
OL,7,Fwoodland in Shropshire is thought to
OL,8,Fhave been caused by discarded glass
OL,9,Fbottles, the fire service said.
OL,11,FTwo Shropshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,12,Fcrews were initially called to the
OL,13,Fincident in High Hatton, near Hodnet,
OL,14,Fat about 14:16 BST on Wednesday.
OL,16,FA large column of smoke could be seen
OL,17,Ffrom some distance away as the blaze
OL,18,Fripped through about 100 square metres
OL,19,Fof stubble, grass and undergrowth and
OL,20,Finto woodland.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
